      "id": "How-to-read-the-app",
      "title": "How to read the app",
      "text": "How to read the app \n       Story by Groups  keeps related evolutionary threads together so the audience can follow the organelles and lineages.  Strict Time Map  ignores grouping and sorts key milestones by date.  Learning Tools  offers four big-picture summaries. Nothing is removed: detailed explanations remain in  Learn More .",
